# No Arbitrary Tailwind Values

Never use Tailwind arbitrary values `[value]` for spacing, typography, or layout.

## Use Design Tokens

Import from `@/constants/design-tokens`:

- **Layout:** `W_FORM`, `W_CONTENT`, `W_SIDEBAR`, `W_COLUMN`, `W_ACTION`
- **Typography:** `PAGE_TITLE_CLASS`, `CARD_TITLE_CLASS`, `TEXT_SMALL`, `TEXT_SMALL_MEDIUM`, `TEXT_SMALL_SEMIBOLD`, `TEXT_SMALL_LEADING`, `TEXT_CAPTION_LEADING`, `TEXT_KPI`, `TEXT_SCORE`, `TEXT_HERO`, `TEXT_BADGE`
- **Spacing:** `PAGE_PADDING`, `SECTION_GAP`, `CARD_CONTENT_PADDING`, `CARD_HEADER_PADDING`, `TIP_BANNER_PADDING`, `FOOTER_PADDING`
- **Radius:** `CARD_RADIUS`, `RADIUS_SM`, `RADIUS_MD`, `RADIUS_LG`

## Allowed

- Standard Tailwind scale: `gap-1`–`gap-12`, `p-1`–`p-12`, `rounded-md`, `rounded-lg`, `rounded-xl`
- Theme utilities: `w-form`, `w-content`, `w-sidebar`, `w-column`, `max-w-hero-title`, `max-w-hero-desc`, `max-w-login-form`
- Design token constants from `@/constants/design-tokens`

## Forbidden

- `p-[13px]`, `w-[900px]`, `text-[22px]`, `rounded-[10px]`, `h-[304px]`, `max-w-[420px]`
- Any `[value]` for spacing, typography, width, height, or radius

## Exceptions

- **`@/constants/design-tokens.ts`** — Arbitrary values allowed only here to define the design scale (e.g. `text-[22px]`, `text-[28px]`)
- shadcn/Radix component internals (e.g. `rounded-[min(var(--radius-md),8px)]`)
- Complex asymmetric radius (e.g. chat bubbles) — prefer `rounded-xl rounded-bl-md` over `rounded-[12px_12px_12px_4px]`
